      { name: "Oversized Turbo Intake Pipe (TIP)", description: "Replacing the restrictive, collapsing factory rubber turbo inlet hose with a rigid silicone unit.", benefit: "Prevents the pipe from sucking shut under high boost, dramatically improving turbo spool time." }
