      "Catalytic Converter Meltdown: Driving the vehicle with chronic ignition coil misfires pumps raw, unburnt fuel directly into the exhaust system, melting the expensive ceramic substrate inside the catalytic converter.",
      "Instrument Cluster (Dash) Pixel Failure: The Jaeger instrument clusters in the 8N TT famously suffer from dead pixel lines and failing stepper motors, making temperature and fuel readings impossible to read."
